### 0. Create a user (required before using the cart)
POST http://localhost:3001/api/users
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Test User",
  "email": "test@example.com"
}

### 1. Seed the Database (Create Products)
POST http://localhost:3001/api/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Gaming Laptop",
  "price": 1200.00,
  "stock": 5
}

### 2. Seed the Database (Create Products)
POST http://localhost:3001/api/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Wireless Mouse",
  "price": 25.00,
  "stock": 20
}

### 2. View All Products
GET http://localhost:3001/api/products

### 3. Add Items to User 1's Cart
POST http://localhost:3001/api/cart
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": 1,
  "productId": 1,
  "quantity": 2
}

###
POST http://localhost:3001/api/cart
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": 1,
  "productId": 2,
  "quantity": 3
}

### 4. View User 1's Cart (Should show 2 Laptops and 3 Mice)
GET http://localhost:3001/api/cart/1

### 5. CHECKOUT! (This triggers the transaction)
POST http://localhost:3001/api/checkout/1

### 6. Verify: Check Stock (Laptop should be 3, Mouse should be 17)
GET http://localhost:3001/api/products

### 7. Verify: Check Cart (Should be empty now!)
GET http://localhost:3001/api/cart/1